---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Privacy policy — Escalat" description="Privacy policy for Escalat." showChat={false} alternates={{ es: "/privacidad", en: "/en/privacy" }}>
  <section class="section legal">
    <div class="container legal__inner">
      <a href="/en/" class="legal__back">← Back to home</a>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Controller:</strong> Escalat (trade name)</li>
        <li><strong>Email:</strong> contacto@escalat.es</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        The controller's full identification details will be published once commercial activity
        begins.
      </p>

      <h2>2. What data we process and why</h2>
      <p>
        We process the data you provide through the contact form and the chat assistant (such as your
        name, phone number, email and the message or need you tell us) in order to handle your request,
        contact you and, where appropriate, prepare a service proposal.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Legal basis</h2>
      <p>
        The legal basis is your <strong>consent</strong>, given when you submit the form or provide your
        data in the chat, and our interest in handling your request.
      </p>

      <h2>4. How long we keep your data</h2>
      <p>
        We keep your data for as long as needed to handle your request and, if we reach an agreement,
        for the duration of the business relationship. Afterwards it is kept blocked for the periods
        legally required.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Who we share your data with</h2>
      <p>
        We do not share your data with third parties except where legally required. We use technology
        providers (for example, hosting and messaging) that act as data processors and comply with data
        protection law.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can exercise your rights of access, rectification, erasure, objection, restriction and
        portability by writing to <a href="mailto:contacto@escalat.es">contacto@escalat.es</a>. You may also
        lodge a complaint with the Spanish Data Protection Agency (www.aepd.es).
      </p>

      <h2>7. AI chat assistant</h2>
      <p>
        Our assistant uses artificial intelligence to answer your questions. Conversations may be
        processed through AI providers to generate the replies. We recommend not sharing sensitive data
        in the chat.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
